# Loaded by `npm run dev` only. Vercel previews and production build in
# production mode and do NOT read this file: set VITE_BUY_URL for them in
# Vercel -> Settings -> Environment Variables (Preview = test, Production = live).
#
# Payment Link URLs are public, so the TEST link is safe to commit here.
# Never put an sk_ or rk_ key in any env file.
#
# Uncomment and paste the test link from Stripe -> Payment Links (test mode):
# VITE_BUY_URL=https://buy.stripe.com/test_XXXXXXXXXXXX
